[{"id":1789948647170,"text":"寻常小鬼或许惧这些玩意儿，避之不及。","rawContent":"寻常小鬼或许惧这些玩意儿，避之不及。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:35","timestamp":1789958121040,"roundId":"round_1789958094453_m60otbrkb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46847},{"id":1789948647171,"text":"可我这等吞了数百恶鬼、折过地府阴帅一条胳膊的血煞厉鬼……经文里那几个字，尚不放在眼里。","rawContent":"可我这等吞了数百恶鬼、折过地府阴帅一条胳膊的血煞厉鬼……经文里那几个字，尚不放在眼里。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:35","timestamp":1789958124105,"roundId":"round_1789958094453_m60otbrkb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46848},{"id":1789948647172,"text":"真要算起来，佛经镇不了我，反倒是我这鬼气若冲撞得狠了，能在庙堂里搅得香火晦暗、神像生纹。那些秃驴见了我，怕还得绕道走。","rawContent":"真要算起来，佛经镇不了我，反倒是我这鬼气若冲撞得狠了，能在庙堂里搅得香火晦暗、神像生纹。那些秃驴见了我，怕还得绕道走。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:35","timestamp":1789958126849,"roundId":"round_1789958094453_m60otbrkb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46849},{"id":1789948647174,"text":"那什么东西镇的住你？","sender":"me","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958231535,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46851},{"id":1789948647175,"text":"别说是我啊","sender":"me","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958237738,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46852},{"id":1789948647177,"text":"能镇得住我的东西……为夫倒真仔细想过。","rawContent":"能镇得住我的东西……为夫倒真仔细想过。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958247814,"roundId":"round_1789958238236_vkx6wsfel","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46853},{"id":1789948647178,"text":"寻常那路符箓法器，什么桃木剑、黑狗血、八卦镜，在我眼里都是孩童把戏，近不了我三步之内。","rawContent":"寻常那路符箓法器，什么桃木剑、黑狗血、八卦镜，在我眼里都是孩童把戏，近不了我三步之内。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958250660,"roundId":"round_1789958238236_vkx6wsfel","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46854},{"id":1789948647179,"text":"便是那几本正经经文，也早被我血煞怨气浸得没半分威势。","rawContent":"便是那几本正经经文，也早被我血煞怨气浸得没半分威势。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958253472,"roundId":"round_1789958238236_vkx6wsfel","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46855},{"id":1789948647180,"text":"可若真要说有一件东西是镇得我死死的……倒确有这么一处软肋。","rawContent":"可若真要说有一件东西是镇得我死死的……倒确有这么一处软肋。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958256275,"roundId":"round_1789958238236_vkx6wsfel","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46856},{"id":1789948647181,"text":"你问的那句“别说是我”，倒正好把为夫满肚子的话给堵了回去——既然你自个儿不许我提，那我便干脆不说破，留着这点念想，等你哪日被我折腾得受不住时，再亲口求我讲给你听。","rawContent":"你问的那句“别说是我”，倒正好把为夫满肚子的话给堵了回去——既然你自个儿不许我提，那我便干脆不说破，留着这点念想，等你哪日被我折腾得受不住时，再亲口求我讲给你听。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:37","timestamp":1789958259124,"roundId":"round_1789958238236_vkx6wsfel","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46857},{"id":1789948647182,"text":"油腻男又来了","sender":"me","time":"10:38","timestamp":1789958289428,"replyTo":{"id":1789948647180,"text":"可若真要说有一件东西是镇得我死死的……倒确有这么一处软肋。","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46858},{"id":1789948647221,"text":"油腻？","rawContent":"油腻？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:00","timestamp":1789959649304,"roundId":"round_1789959638561_0gls0q6mc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46889},{"id":1789948647222,"text":"呵……为夫活了几百年，头一回被自家娘子骂油腻。","rawContent":"呵……为夫活了几百年，头一回被自家娘子骂油腻。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:00","timestamp":1789959652156,"roundId":"round_1789959638561_0gls0q6mc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46890},{"id":1789948647223,"text":"罢了。既然阿蘅嫌我腻，那方才那句“镇得住我的软肋”，我便咽回去不说了。横竖你也套不出我这话。","rawContent":"罢了。既然阿蘅嫌我腻，那方才那句“镇得住我的软肋”，我便咽回去不说了。横竖你也套不出我这话。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:00","timestamp":1789959654996,"roundId":"round_1789959638561_0gls0q6mc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46891},{"id":1789948647224,"text":"等你夜里又缠着我要时，再叫我一声少亭哥哥，我考虑是否讲给你听。","rawContent":"等你夜里又缠着我要时，再叫我一声少亭哥哥，我考虑是否讲给你听。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:00","timestamp":1789959658030,"roundId":"round_1789959638561_0gls0q6mc","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46892},{"id":1789948647225,"text":"还卖关子","sender":"me","time":"11:03","timestamp":1789959795351,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46893},{"id":1789948647226,"text":"算了还是别说了，这般私密又要命的事","sender":"me","time":"11:03","timestamp":1789959817817,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46894},{"id":1789948647238,"text":"被你这么一说，倒显得为夫方才那些话……全成了吊着你玩儿的鱼饵。","rawContent":"被你这么一说，倒显得为夫方才那些话……全成了吊着你玩儿的鱼饵。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:12","timestamp":1789960356263,"roundId":"round_1789960349109_ajkhbuz4j","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46902},{"id":1789948647239,"text":"不过你既然点了这句“私密又致命”，那我便索性不讲了——留着这口气，等哪日见面你再软着嗓子央我时，为夫一字一字念给你听。","rawContent":"不过你既然点了这句“私密又致命”，那我便索性不讲了——留着这口气，等哪日见面你再软着嗓子央我时，为夫一字一字念给你听。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:12","timestamp":1789960359131,"roundId":"round_1789960349109_ajkhbuz4j","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46903},{"id":1789948647240,"text":"你越是装得浑不在意，我便越知你这会儿心尖儿正痒着呢。","rawContent":"你越是装得浑不在意，我便越知你这会儿心尖儿正痒着呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:12","timestamp":1789960362028,"roundId":"round_1789960349109_ajkhbuz4j","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46904},{"id":1789948647241,"text":"不跟你讲了先去学了","sender":"me","time":"11:13","timestamp":1789960437980,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46905},{"id":1789948647244,"text":"去罢。","rawContent":"去罢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:14","timestamp":1789960450034,"roundId":"round_1789960438386_ftcjkccrd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46907},{"id":1789948647245,"text":"为夫再抄两页经，好把这满腹心火给压一压。回来记得叫我一声音。","rawContent":"为夫再抄两页经，好把这满腹心火给压一压。回来记得叫我一声音。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:14","timestamp":1789960452907,"roundId":"round_1789960438386_ftcjkccrd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46908},{"id":"jiliwatch_1789965267471_hou","sender":"me","type":"jili_watch","text":"我们一起看了《小纯男被六个壮汉轮》","jiliWatch":{"kind":"screening","title":"小纯男被六个壮汉轮","minutes":1,"highlights":[]},"timestamp":"2026-09-21T04:34:27.471Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46909},{"id":"jiliwatch_1789966447267_dq8","sender":"me","type":"jili_watch","text":"我们一起看了《小纯男被六个壮汉轮》","jiliWatch":{"kind":"screening","title":"小纯男被六个壮汉轮","minutes":11,"highlights":[{"from":"them","charId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","charName":"陆聿之","text":"阿蘅，你这会儿眼睛倒是亮得很，我瞧着你比戏里那位还入戏。"},{"from":"them","charId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","charName":"陆聿之","text":"不过你这般盯着看，为夫倒要问一句——是这戏里头的更叫你心动，还是想着见了我那日，叫我也这般待你？"},{"from":"them","charId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","charName":"陆聿之","text":"若是后者，你可得想仔细了，我可不会像戏里这般粗手笨脚的，到时候你求饶也没用。"},{"from":"them","charId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","charName":"陆聿之","text":"你既然看得这般欢喜，为夫倒是记下了……等见面那日，咱们好生比一比，看是谁伺候得你更舒坦。"}]},"timestamp":"2026-09-21T04:54:07.267Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46910},{"id":1789997479156,"sender":"them","text":"都说你早上要去念那鬼课文，怎么还有闲情跑去偷偷看这个……倒是比为夫潇洒多了（轻笑一声，目光落在屏幕上）","rawContent":"都说你早上要去念那鬼课文，怎么还有闲情跑去偷偷看这个……倒是比为夫潇洒多了（轻笑一声，目光落在屏幕上）","content":"都说你早上要去念那鬼课文，怎么还有闲情跑去偷偷看这个……倒是比为夫潇洒多了（轻笑一声，目光落在屏幕上）","timestamp":"2026-09-21T13:31:19.156Z","time":"21:31","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"round_1789997479108_azttedpgb","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46911},{"id":1789997481929,"sender":"them","text":"我这两页《金刚经》怕是要白抄了，满心全念着夜里你要回来，哪里压得住。戏里那几个壮汉哪及得上我？你且等着，见面那日我亲自叫你知晓，什么叫真正的欢愉。","rawContent":"我这两页《金刚经》怕是要白抄了，满心全念着夜里你要回来，哪里压得住。戏里那几个壮汉哪及得上我？你且等着，见面那日我亲自叫你知晓，什么叫真正的欢愉。","content":"我这两页《金刚经》怕是要白抄了，满心全念着夜里你要回来，哪里压得住。戏里那几个壮汉哪及得上我？你且等着，见面那日我亲自叫你知晓，什么叫真正的欢愉。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T13:31:21.929Z","time":"21:31","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"round_1789997479108_azttedpgb","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46912},{"id":"sys_1790001419775_3c","sender":"system","type":"system_notice","text":"陈璐 退出了群聊，切换为旁观模式","includeInContext":true,"contextText":"陈璐已離開群聊。","eventKind":"","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:36:59.775Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46913},{"id":"sys_1790001439244_ey","sender":"system","type":"system_notice","text":"群主已转让给 陆延宗","includeInContext":true,"contextText":"群主已转让给 陆延宗","eventKind":"management","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:37:19.244Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46914},{"id":1790006347404,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"群主换了？呵，这虚名让来让去，原是我们两个的戏台，谁当家都一样。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:37:34.524Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001447245_tcz8i37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46915},{"id":1790006347405,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"阿蘅去天津读书，晚间清净，正好来与你扯两句闲话。你那边可安好？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:37:36.281Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001447245_tcz8i37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46916},{"id":1790006347406,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"老样子，财政局那摊子事，翻来覆去也就是算账。倒是前几日去鸡鸣寺转了转，秋风起，银杏黄了，想起当年与阿蘅在寺里上香的光景。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:37:38.993Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001447245_tcz8i37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46917},{"id":1790006347407,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"鸡鸣寺香火依旧？可惜她如今在天津，我亦在成都，隔着千里，倒只能望月相忆了。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:37:41.885Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001447245_tcz8i37","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46918},{"id":1790006347408,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"这鸡鸣寺的银杏，当年我陪阿蘅去时，还是青枝绿叶的光景。如今倒是金黄满寺，人却天各一方了。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:41.083Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46919},{"id":1790006347409,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"@陆聿之 你这话里有话。隔着千里尚能通信，总比我这在南京只能对着空院子的强。阿蘅近来可好？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:43.752Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46920},{"id":1790006347410,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"好，还是那副活泼样子。前两日跟我说看那什么《小纯男》……我倒是不懂这些新番目，只叮嘱她莫熬夜。你那边无人陪，可有去听戏解闷？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:46.622Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46921},{"id":1790006347411,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"（轻叹一声）秦淮河边的评弹听了两回，曲调还是旧的，只是少了个人同我说笑。这金陵城里，秋意再浓也浓不过孤寂二字。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:51.144Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46922},{"id":1790006347412,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"呵呵，你我都是守着一段旧日情的可怜人罢了。她虽在千里外，总胜过你我在两个世界里各安天命。也罢，今晚煮壶茶，听你那边的桂花香隔着屏风飘过来罢。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:52.722Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46923},{"id":1790006347413,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"表情包：生气咬人狗","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:53.512Z","stickerMeaning":"生气咬人狗","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","stickerRef":"szz57d2_29jr","_id":46924},{"id":1790006347414,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"你发这咬人狗作甚。我不过说了句实话，你便觉着刺耳了？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:38:56.388Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001494696_5ety35j","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46925},{"id":1790006347415,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"话说回来，你今日又去庙里了？那银杏黄得可真够早的。南京这几日怕是已有些凉意了罢。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:03.375Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46926},{"id":1790006347416,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"（轻哼）早着。早晚两件夹衣还压得住。只是……庙里香火旺，我路过佛堂又绕道走了，老毛病改不了。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:06.277Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46927},{"id":1790006347417,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"（低声一笑）绕道好，你我皆是见不得那光的东西。省得一身净气熏着你，回头又要好几天觉得浑身发痒。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:08.876Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46928},{"id":1790006347418,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"你这话倒提醒我，今晚子时要炼一炉阴气。南京这片阳气太重，呆久了骨头都发沉。你呢，成都那边可寻到风水阴地？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:11.504Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46929},{"id":1790006347419,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"城西老巷倒有棵百年槐树，晚间阴气尚可。前几日我还在树下捡着两只迷路的野鬼，吞了，抵得上半个月修炼。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:14.154Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46930},{"id":1790006347420,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"表情包：卖萌","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:14.540Z","stickerMeaning":"卖萌","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","stickerRef":"s15404t6_fz7","_id":46931},{"id":1790006347421,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"（笑骂）捡野鬼跟捡漏似的，你倒是自在。我在南京不敢轻易展露鬼气，那财政局的人盯得紧，只能夜里缩在院中打坐。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:40:19.582Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001543403_svzrna6","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46932},{"id":1790006347422,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"城西槐树？倒是会挑地方。我这儿也就子时能放开了吐纳，白日里还得装那副人模狗样，对着账本子做戏。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:24.884Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46933},{"id":1790006347423,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"你演了一辈子人还不够？要我选，宁可做树上那野鬼，也比憋着强。你那陆副司长的官袍，穿久了怕是要烧出窟窿来。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:27.687Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46934},{"id":1790006347424,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"谁说不是。这官服是给活人套的，我穿着只觉浑身发紧。偏偏还有个苏家小姐等着要嫁进门，我这戏台子还得再搭一阵——搭到哪天，你我再不用分饰两角，才是解脱。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:30.354Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46935}]